<!-- CA:BEGIN:AC-05 -->
<article class="record" id="AC-05" data-ca-symbol="AC-05" data-ca-kind="criteria"><div class="record-head"><a class="id" href="#AC-05">AC-05</a><h3>Owned sound and terminal polish</h3><span class="badge">must</span></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Applicability</span><div class="fields"><div class="field"><span class="label">Mode</span>unconditional</div><div class="field"><span class="label">Rationale</span>Required for the bounded playable prototype loop.</div></div></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Constraint refs</span><ul class="items"><li><a href="#CONSTRAINT-01">CONSTRAINT-01</a></li><li><a href="#CONSTRAINT-02">CONSTRAINT-02</a></li></ul></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Intent refs</span><ul class="items"><li><a href="#SCOPE-03">SCOPE-03</a></li></ul></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Kind</span>behavior</div><div class="field"><span class="label">Scenarios</span><span class="missing">None recorded</span></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Source refs</span><ul class="items"><li><a href="#SRC-01">SRC-01</a></li></ul></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Statement</span>Use original procedural cannon, impact/destruction, defeat and purchase cues with a bounded voice pool, a visible session-persistent mute, and Web unlock from Deploy. Paused/hidden states stop sound and do not replay queued cues. Let terminal shot/impact visuals settle without advancing ended combat before showing results.</div><div class="field"><span class="label">Verification</span>
<!-- CA:BEGIN:VERIFY-05 -->
<article class="record" id="VERIFY-05" data-ca-symbol="VERIFY-05" data-ca-kind="verification"><div class="record-head"><a class="id" href="#VERIFY-05">VERIFY-05</a><h3>Verification</h3></div><div class="field"><span class="label">Evidence state</span>planned</div><div class="field"><span class="label">Method</span>automated_and_review</div><div class="field"><span class="label">Negative control</span>A looping/queued burst, muted cue, hidden audio or resumed terminal model tick fails inspection/check.</div><div class="field"><span class="label">Oracle</span>Shot, hit/kill, defeat and buy have distinct audible feedback at normal speed; mute and pause/focus suppress it, and terminal model tick/hull remain fixed while admitted transients settle.</div><div class="field"><span class="label">Planned target</span>Real Unity pause/terminal/audio-owner check plus normal-speed Web capture/listen and mute/pause interaction</div></article>
